ogy\nLatest Revision: 2024-02-18\nValid as Of: 2024-02-18\nVersion: 2313\n\n--- Record 3426 ---\nComponent: Migration Assessment\nEnvironment: Cloud Foundry\nTitle: New Rules Added\nDescription: The following rules have been added for Migration Assessment:      OMUsageDoNotResolveXOPIncludes: Check if Do Not Resolve XOP Includes is enabled in operation mapping.      SenderRESTURLPattern: Evaluate the parameters configured in the URL.    \nAction: Info only\nLifecycle: General Availability\nType: New\nLine of Business: Technology\nLatest Revision: 2024-02-18\nValid as Of: 2024-02-18\nVersion: 2313\n\n--- Record 3427 ---\nComponent: Migration Assessment\nEnvironment: Cloud Foundry\nTitle: No Extraction Limit for Integration Scenarios\nDescription: The extraction limit for integration scenarios no longer applies. You can now extract any number of integration scenarios from your SAP Process Orchestration System.\nAction: Info only\nLifecycle: General Availability\nType: New\nLine of Business: Technology\nLatest Revision: 2024-02-18\nValid as Of: 2024-02-18\nVersion: 2313\n\n--- Record 3428 ---\nComponent: Migration Assessment\nEnvironment: Cloud Foundry\nTitle: Software Version Update\nDescription:     Migration Assessment: 1.24.*      Increment: 2313    \nAction: Info only\nLifecycle: General Availability\nType: New\nLine of Business: Technology\nLatest Revision: 2024-02-18\nValid as Of: 2024-02-18\nVersion: 2313\n\n--- Record 3429 ---\nComponent: SAP AI Core\nEnvironment: Cloud Foundry\nTitle: Authentication\nDescription: Authentication through X.509 certificates is supported.  For more information, see Create a Service Key and Use a Service Key.\nAction: Info only\nLifecycle: General Availability\nType: New\",431\n213,\"--- Record 4121 ---\nComponent: Integration Assessment\nEnvironment: Cloud Foundry\nTitle: Software Version Update\nDescription:     Integration Assessment: 1.19.*    Increment: 2308  \nAction: Info only\nLifecycle: General Availability\nType: Changed